@startuml
title APE3 - Alta de carrera existente; resultado esperado, no captura ejecutada
actor "Administrador funcional" as Admin
participant "CareerController" as API
participant "CareerAdministrationService" as App
participant "CurrentActorPort / AuthorizationPort" as Auth
participant "CareerCatalogRepository" as Repo
participant "AuditPort" as Audit
Admin -> API : POST /api/v1/careers\nCookie + CSRF + JSON
note over API
  Filtros autentican y verifican CSRF antes del controlador.
  DTO invalido puede rechazar antes de llegar al servicio.
end note
API -> App : createCareer(input.data(), correlation)
App -> Auth : requireAdmin()
App -> Repo : findUnit(academicUnitId)
App -> Repo : careerCodeExists(code, null)
alt Unidad activa y codigo disponible
  App -> App : Crear Career ACTIVE, revision 1
  App -> Repo : saveCareer(value, -1, actor, CAREER_CREATED)
  App -> Audit : record(evento)
  App --> API : Career
  API --> Admin : 201 + Location + ETag + Career
else Unidad no disponible o codigo duplicado
  App --> API : CareerCatalogException(422 o 409)
  API --> Admin : Problem Details del handler
end
note over App, Audit
  Servicio transaccional: verificar atomicidad con prueba integrada.
  No inferir commit exitoso solo por este diagrama.
end note
@enduml
